Windows Registry Editor Version 5.00

; tiny11sc: boot.wim index 2 (Windows Setup). A Qubes HVM has no TPM and boots SeaBIOS, so
; Win11 Setup refuses it without these. The rig's answer stick sets the same keys from its windowsPE
; pass; having them in the media makes an interactive install work too.

[HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\SYSTEM\Setup\LabConfig]
"BypassTPMCheck"=dword:00000001
"BypassSecureBootCheck"=dword:00000001
"BypassRAMCheck"=dword:00000001
"BypassStorageCheck"=dword:00000001
"BypassCPUCheck"=dword:00000001
